Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.46,0:01:52.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(537.6,589.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}A Blood-soaked Ballgame:
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.46,0:01:52.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1156.6,782.8)\fnPapyrus\fs60}The Kyun of Victory Shines On You
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.38,0:01:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monami, our dear comrade?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.12,0:01:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can only imagine the\Nregret from never realizing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:58.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your dream of setting\Noff the Akiba Big Bang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the stardust memory you leave behind\Nlives on in our hearts for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.04,0:02:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.04,0:02:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And why is Manami's funeral\Nin this shitty place?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.92,0:02:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all the mess with the merger,\NCreatureland probably didn't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to make nice arrangements.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is this a merger?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We work for Creatureland now\Nand the made alien name is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.86,0:02:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a freaking takeover.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.40,0:02:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you have a problem with her decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.68,0:02:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop your bickering.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.88,0:02:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're at a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.76,0:02:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that the Creatures and\NE.T.'s have joined hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Minami must be smiling\Ndown on us from the start above.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.66,0:02:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if it isn't the\Nfellow from Creatureland.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.26,0:02:37.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who is this with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.70,0:02:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The manager of the Oinky Doink Cafe. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.00,0:02:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Oinky Doink Cafe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.78,0:02:48.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please accept my deepest\Ncondolences for your tragic loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:51.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We appreciate you coming all\Nthis way for us on this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a sad and unexpected tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.16,0:02:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These must be such\Ndifficult times for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.18,0:02:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.09,0:03:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Having lived your lives as alien\Ninvaders and adventurers of space.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.38,0:03:03.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may find some of our ways odd.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.60,0:03:06.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there is anything we as more\Nexperienced creatures can do to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.71,0:03:09.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugaki and her new friends have\Nalready made a fabulous start as
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,creatures Their profits have already\Nexceeded that of Oinky Doink?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.16,0:03:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the axolotl as their theme They have
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.80,0:03:19.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rebranded as the Memory\NLane Animal Cafe Blam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.82,0:03:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think axolotls are creatures?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course they're creatures\NWhat's all this commotion?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.06,0:03:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.34,0:03:37.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Settle the score with this. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A friendly game of baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.42,0:03:42.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an order from our leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.24,0:03:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've ordered us to play\Nbaseball? Count me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't be bothered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.68,0:03:47.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.59,0:03:48.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we tried to murder each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.86,0:03:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's too funny. Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll wash away our\Ndifferences with our sweat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We couldn't ask for a more peaceful\Nsolution to all this fighting,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.36,0:03:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good playing a game with\Nbats and peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:03:59.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make sure it does.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll happily chase after the\Nball together and patch things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.00,0:04:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever we just have\Nto play along for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.38,0:04:06.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.29,0:04:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we're going to do this we have to\Nplay to win Someone's all fired up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.62,0:04:12.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but can you play baseball\Nwith just seven people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:27.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For all those who fell in the\Nrecent ruckus, a moment of silence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula, you just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.72,0:04:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise we'll make up and all\Nbecome friends during this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.48,0:04:39.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said a moment of silence, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.04,0:04:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, do we really have\Nto play ball and all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all know who won. Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.68,0:04:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.94,0:04:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, like, you quit being aliens and now\Nyou're just asshole toodles or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.06,0:04:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's axolotls!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:53.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get cocky, bottom feeder!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:56.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What stops that bottom\Nfeeders like them have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:58.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,their own struggles to\Ndeal with bottom feeders?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.50,0:05:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see I've been impressed\Nby how unfazed you seem to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.54,0:05:04.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be despite being ridiculed\Nas a burden to creature land!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:07.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, now, let's all just have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.16,0:05:10.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This match is partly to commemorate\Nyou becoming axi morons Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.82,0:05:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or was it asshole toodles?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.48,0:05:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:17.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can settle our disagreements\Nwith baseball Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.16,0:05:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's have fun and play each\Nother fair and square Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.74,0:05:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll take you fucking pigs out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.24,0:05:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.10,0:05:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forced to change our\Npersona by creature land?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.72,0:05:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our honor as extraterrestrials trampled?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know all too well\Nhow frustrated you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.10,0:05:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is war, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.84,0:05:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go show them how we're\Neons out of their league!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is war, pigs! No, it's not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.52,0:05:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are they calling a damn burden?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what dirty tricks you use.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.10,0:05:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go crush them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.18,0:05:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Playing rough is out of the question!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, now, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to win by playing fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:53.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't resort to violence now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.34,0:05:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want Nerula and the\Nothers' sacrifices to be in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.32,0:05:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point in all of\Nthis if we don't play fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.84,0:05:59.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's do this.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.26,0:06:03.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(563.6,331.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Axolotls
Dialogue: 1,0:06:00.26,0:06:03.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(552.4,585.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Oinky Doink
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.18,0:06:06.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(678.4,772.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Pitcher ~ Zoya
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.10,0:06:07.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(670.4,756.2)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Catcher ~ Nagomi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.64,0:06:09.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(515,759.4)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Second Base ~  Yumechi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Short stop!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.43,0:06:11.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(942.4,752)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Shortstop ~ Shiipon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi! Shippon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't hear you out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.00,0:06:15.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's like more of a pain than usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.14,0:06:15.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.56,0:06:18.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(492.8,784)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}First Base ~ Okachimachi
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.98,0:06:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Third!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now to the pitcher!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:18.57,0:06:20.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(646.4,756.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Third Base ~ Ranko
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.20,0:06:21.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, outfield!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.44,0:06:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear some noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hell! Hell! Si, Hell! Hell!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.07,0:06:23.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(747.2,792)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Left Field ~ Jose
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.95,0:06:24.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(656,780.8)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Center Field ~ Luis
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.82,0:06:25.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(731.2,720)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Right Field ~ Antonio
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:26.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.90,0:06:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some guys chief recruited?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.36,0:06:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to be\Nreally good at baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:33.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoya says she can't understand\Na word they're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's play ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.74,0:06:42.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at, pig?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.12,0:06:44.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's fired up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.34,0:06:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She looked up to Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.82,0:06:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.86,0:06:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll crush this pitch up to\Nwhere you are, Ms. Manami.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.28,0:07:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.30,0:07:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That pitch came in nice and fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.30,0:07:10.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great work, Zoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.94,0:07:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get your butts out there\Nand go shut them out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:26.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, batter batter!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.98,0:07:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their pitcher hasn't even warmed up yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.32,0:07:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That first pitch will be nice and easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:32.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better be ready, Sheepod!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is such a drag.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.92,0:07:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, I didn't mean to hit that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.14,0:07:41.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice batting!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.24,0:07:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pitcher's off to a bad start!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.12,0:07:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.36,0:07:48.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.72,0:07:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, you stupid idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.02,0:07:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's good for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.09,0:07:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Yumechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.01,0:07:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell am I on base\Nanyways? Lead off! Lead off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.12,0:08:01.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Runner's gonna run!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:03.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I so don't really wanna run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.36,0:08:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You act like you've played\Nbefore, yeah I played.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.04,0:08:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a bit back in the joint\Nstrike strike Batter!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.14,0:08:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gotta swing to hit the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.90,0:08:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that, batter?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.68,0:08:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I shall swing, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.44,0:08:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.04,0:08:43.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw it home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.30,0:08:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw it home!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.18,0:08:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wasting our time, Asphibians! Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.06,0:08:52.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you all doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.90,0:08:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I actually\Nused to play softball.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:08:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.00,0:09:01.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.40,0:09:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.18,0:09:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strike three!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.34,0:09:06.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Batter's out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.25,0:09:08.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, I've got the timing down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:10.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind, never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shake it off, Team Pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:19.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, crush those amphibians!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.58,0:09:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, secret weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.94,0:09:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike them out if you wanna live!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.64,0:09:31.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:36.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.84,0:09:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say they were good at baseball?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.22,0:09:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.50,0:09:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the deal with those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.04,0:09:44.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're foreign exchange students.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.84,0:09:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm at an electric town buying cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.96,0:09:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time we end fair play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.86,0:09:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go crush those pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.80,0:09:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, coach, we got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.96,0:10:00.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I think it's time we\Nstart this game for real now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's strike two.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.72,0:10:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't hit it! Batter's blind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Batter's Blam!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, just watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.94,0:10:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nogome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.54,0:10:28.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagomi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.45,0:10:29.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.18,0:10:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chief, call an ambulance.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.74,0:10:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure we need an ambulance?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.34,0:10:34.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big fuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.40,0:10:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I barely even hit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.10,0:10:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oops, sorry, my bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.74,0:10:40.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you little bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're the one who started it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.06,0:10:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're asking!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.97,0:10:44.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault. No violence!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.84,0:10:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I, I interfered.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I leaned in way too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.50,0:10:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.41,0:10:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catcher's interference.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Batter goes to first.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.64,0:10:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, that Blam\Nmoron's the one to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.16,0:11:00.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think you should go sit\Ndown and get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.84,0:11:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see this through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.00,0:11:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's keep our chins up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yumechi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.99,0:11:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was tag her, she's out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.96,0:11:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was more than that, you bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.98,0:11:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cross them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.89,0:11:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cross them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.28,0:11:29.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.80,0:11:32.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you always have\Nto resort to violence?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.52,0:11:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just got her out using\Nmy knuckleball. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you even saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not playing baseball at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.04,0:11:41.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the only one\Nplaying baseball, Nagomi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.34,0:11:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then what are the rest of you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.62,0:11:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being a nail-oink!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:57.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.98,0:12:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This won't change the way we play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to win, playing fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.48,0:12:08.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good, we've turned the tables.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.66,0:12:10.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,410)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Axolotls
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.66,0:12:10.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,713)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Oinky Doink
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.42,0:12:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them score any more runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.24,0:12:12.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, take out a mate\Nor two while you're at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.84,0:12:13.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:15.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are totally coming for us, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.98,0:12:16.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.89,0:12:17.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to rumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is the right move here to choke\Nup on the bat and go swish?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.32,0:12:29.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or else should I go swoosh instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.40,0:12:34.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No. It's a slider.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.42,0:12:36.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to break here and...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:37.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:38.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those tricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.64,0:12:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, guys. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.48,0:12:43.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll lead off and put\Nthe pressure on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck at the plate!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.12,0:12:49.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, she's gonna\Nend up dead real quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.78,0:12:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:12:59.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The three outs, switch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.00,0:13:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go out there and crush\Nevery last one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.18,0:13:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.09,0:13:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you two there, are you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:08.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a maid out there\Nwho's playing fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.72,0:13:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:11.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a maid out there\Nplaying fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.72,0:13:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:14.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you two arguing with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.54,0:13:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's out there playing fair and square!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.44,0:13:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna do not say fair and square!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.60,0:13:19.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.51,0:13:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.43,0:13:21.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.34,0:13:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, you little...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you get back here! For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.80,0:13:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko's playing fair now, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.32,0:13:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a maid shouldn't have to put\Nup with someone giving him crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.24,0:13:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know provoking the\Nenemy is a futile exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:36.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Futile?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.33,0:13:37.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Axo, Axo, Axo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:40.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want me to keep sniffing off your\Nlimbs till they stop growing back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.06,0:13:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, you button-feeted hog!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's futile. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:51.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.84,0:13:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.20,0:13:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice play, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.72,0:13:59.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just really want to\Nget this over with, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.50,0:14:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's finish these lizards off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.84,0:14:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knuckleheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.42,0:14:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you ashamed this game is so close?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.33,0:14:09.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,410)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Axolotls
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.33,0:14:09.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(154,713)\fnSwis721 BT\fs41}Oinky Doink
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.54,0:14:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.00,0:14:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.56,0:14:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your nails totally split.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.42,0:14:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can still pitch if I rip it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.72,0:14:17.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.12,0:14:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then who's gonna pitch for us now?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:20.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allow me to pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Ronko! You can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.66,0:14:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're still injured! I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.50,0:14:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.30,0:14:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.64,0:14:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:37.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oink! Doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:39.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oink! Oink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:41.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oink, oink, oink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.34,0:14:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we're on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.56,0:14:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the piggies are their fangs!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.06,0:14:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oink!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.22,0:14:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up, Kasumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.74,0:14:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do whatever you've\Ngot to do to get on base!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you even listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:53.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I think she's talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.70,0:14:56.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way we're falling\Nfor your stupid tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:57.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.19,0:14:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.94,0:15:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.04,0:15:12.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike three, you're out! Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this frickin' rate,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.38,0:15:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we lose to these smelly bottom\Nfeeders, our reputation is done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.56,0:15:21.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Umpire, I'm pitch hitting!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.66,0:15:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she even allowed to bat?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.78,0:15:27.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, I can't let things in like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.86,0:15:31.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm the head of\Nthe made alien group, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.42,0:15:34.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No bottom-feeding swine\Nis going to ever...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.38,0:15:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.46,0:15:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fuck me to turn you into a peroski!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.82,0:15:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you fucking kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.84,0:15:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You asshole-lots never learn, do ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.34,0:15:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.50,0:15:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one's gonna be hitting anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.04,0:15:55.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You little f...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.38,0:16:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.58,0:16:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.92,0:16:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really did it, Miss Monami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miyabi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.38,0:16:13.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.36,0:16:18.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.36,0:16:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko, we need to call an ambulance now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.32,0:16:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How how could this happen? I\Njust wanted to play a proper
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.54,0:16:41.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,game of baseball with no violence or
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:48.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bloodshed considering
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we've had some actual casualties\Nthey're not dead huh hey
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.00,0:16:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you that's right\Nthey're not dead right girls yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.16,0:16:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.68,0:17:00.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get back to the dugout, Mistress.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.92,0:17:03.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go, axolotl mascot. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.80,0:17:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're not dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, of course, that's\Nwhat they said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.38,0:17:08.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.29,0:17:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we can keep playing baseball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.94,0:17:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.85,0:17:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's turn this bitch up a notch!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.70,0:17:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we'll restart the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.08,0:17:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's play ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.08,0:17:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.26,0:17:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.24,0:17:20.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:22.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their coach looks super intense, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:25.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't they adjust her angle a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.38,0:17:27.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.44,0:17:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,OK, let's finish this game off right!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.12,0:17:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's two outs. Now let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.52,0:17:38.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dead ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.82,0:17:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.54,0:17:41.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.66,0:17:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's up to you now, El!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.56,0:17:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know a lot has happened out\Nhere, but we've made it this far?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and they're playing properly now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.56,0:17:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we're about to achieve\Nsomething amazing on this field today.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:55.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to win this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.44,0:17:58.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okie dokie, oikie doink!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:16.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some nice pitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.38,0:18:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Elle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:21.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, show them what we're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.88,0:18:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, axolotls, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.68,0:18:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Axolotos! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Axolotos!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.32,0:18:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.46,0:18:32.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.78,0:18:33.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't let you win.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:36.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to lose this game, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.86,0:18:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because beyond this game, I'm sure a\Nnew future is waiting for us maids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.66,0:18:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.68,0:18:55.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.59,0:18:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Game's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:18:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.42,0:19:00.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:09.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.50,0:19:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those pig heads really beat us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they did. We lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:16.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, it was a really good game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.30,0:19:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pigs, and we hail thee.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:27.44,0:19:30.94,Insert08,,0,0,0,,O dear pigsty
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.68,0:19:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The object of our crime.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.94,0:19:35.24,Insert08,,0,0,0,,The object of our pride
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where our bones will be for all time?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.24,0:19:39.41,Insert08,,0,0,0,,Where we'll bury our bones
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.41,0:19:44.25,Insert08,,0,0,0,,And offer our backfat
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.68,0:19:43.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back, back, to sea, and brine!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For our masters tis a theme.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.25,0:19:47.96,Insert08,,0,0,0,,For our masters in complete servitude
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.20,0:19:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will serve with smiles.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We snort as pigs.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.96,0:19:50.09,Insert08,,0,0,0,,We snort as pigs
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.00,0:19:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We snort as pigs.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.09,0:19:52.25,Insert08,,0,0,0,,We snort as pigs
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nerula, we did it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.25,0:19:56.01,Insert08,,0,0,0,,Oinky Doink Café!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.22,0:19:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got through a good, honest game.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.24,0:20:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've aged, Ronko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.14,0:20:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usuko, you're alive and well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.26,0:20:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You assumed I was dead? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.82,0:20:13.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I searched for you,\Nbut it was all in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.22,0:20:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ronko, I want you to know I've\Nclimbed to the very top of Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I now go by the name Nagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.20,0:20:20.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.11,0:20:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So does that mean you're the\Nhead of the Creatureland group?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.64,0:20:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.55,0:20:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you suppose Miss Michio\Nwould say if she saw me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.00,0:20:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.38,0:20:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was because of me that Miss Michio...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.74,0:20:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only you had taken up your\Ngun before all that happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.46,0:20:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The made alien woman with the red bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.46,0:20:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.60,0:20:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.51,0:20:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That brand of foolishness\Ngot Miss Michio killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.16,0:20:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is drawing with ketchup the\Nonly thing this hand can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.40,0:20:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:56.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bronco!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.15,0:20:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're about to start our meeting!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.18,0:20:59.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.28,0:21:02.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight for the sake of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.84,0:21:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you'll have no place\Nto call home here in Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.52,0:21:10.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bit too old now for all\Nthis super-duper smooch crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.22,0:21:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you know her? I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.54,0:21:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were once colleagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.44,0:21:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite a super-deluxe\Nmaid outfit she's wearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.34,0:21:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugaki was already dead at the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.22,0:21:26.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.48,0:21:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What could work by an unexpected intruder?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe that should clear\Nup the last of the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.40,0:21:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we'll see.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.02,0:21:38.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,366.4)\fnPapyrus\fs60}Oinky Doink Café
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.44,0:21:39.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on resuming operations!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.98,0:21:42.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect the cafe to be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, those three\Nhelped fix up the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.98,0:21:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wanted Nerula to know\Nthat I was doing fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to Dream Pig and go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.10,0:21:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,DREAM PIG GO! GO!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight for the sake of the group.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.36,0:22:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, you'll have no place\Nto call home here in Akiba.
